  "title": "Per-seat billing replaces metered credits",
  "summary": "PR Lens switches GitHub installation billing from metered per-run credits with spending caps to licensed per-seat plans (Essentials and Team) with a 5-day trial. Private pull requests are admitted by developer seat rather than monthly credit counters, auto-expanding capacity in Stripe or prompting for approval. New plan selection and seat management routes allow approvers to manage seats, toggling auto-expansion or freeing seats.",
